 (('降息可能降低新增或重新定价贷款的融资成本，但不等于每个人都更容易获批。贷款价格与能否通过银行审批，是两个需要分开核对的问题。','A rate cut can lower financing costs for new or repriced loans, but does not mean everyone can qualify. The price of credit and eligibility for credit must be checked separately.'),['rates','eligibility']),
